> What was the Guaspi rule?

Gua\spi differs from Lojban in two ways (regarding FA):

1) The position of the selbri has no effect on which slots an argument 
fills.
2) After using a FA, it doesn't count from that FA but instead goes back 
to wherever you were before (this is also the case in Toaq Dzu).

So in Gua\spi "broda mi do" == "mi broda do", and "mi broda fi do ko'a" 
== "mi broda ko'a do".

